\_form#0=526x29:\[ x_{k,m,l}(n)=A \exp (j2\pi\frac{f_R}{N_{RFFT}}n + j2\pi\frac{f_A}{N_{AFFT}}(m+m_{azim}(l)) + j\varphi_{elev}(l)+j2\pi\frac{f_D}{N_{Tx}N_{DFFT}}k) + noise \]
